6. Interest and Fees

The interest rate applicable to this Loan shall be 5.5% per annum, compounded monthly. The Borrower shall pay interest on the outstanding principal amount of the Loan on a monthly basis, commencing on the first day of the first month following the Agreement Date.

The Borrower shall also pay a loan origination fee equal to 1% of the Loan Amount, which shall be deducted from the Loan proceeds at closing. The Borrower shall pay a late payment fee of 5% of the unpaid principal amount, which shall be charged on any payment that is not received by the Lender within five (5) days of its due date.

The Lender shall have the right to charge a default interest rate of 18% per annum on any outstanding principal amount that is in default. The Borrower shall pay all interest and fees accrued on the Loan, including any late payment fees and default interest, on the maturity date of the Loan.

The Borrower shall pay all interest and fees to the Lender at the address specified in the Contact Information section of this Agreement. The Borrower shall make payments in accordance with the Repayment Terms set forth in Section 3 of this Agreement.

7. Default and Remedies
